{"1558800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forgot", "steam_appid": 1558800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgot</strong> is a short anomaly hunting horror game. You play as a boy who is imprisoned at home with his grandparents. But is this really your home and are you sure those are your grandparents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to leave, but no exit leads to the outside. The rooms are looping endlessly and time seems to be standing still. It is midnight and &quot;grandmother&quot; won't let you leave before the morning. She keeps feeding you cake and sends you back to your room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes your surroundings change and sometimes they stay the same... Look out for anomalies and make a decision:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are there anomalies at home?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cake is poisoned, do <strong>NOT</strong> eat it and leave immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Does everything look normal?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cake is <strong>safe</strong> and delicious, make sure to eat it on your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only if you make <strong>12</strong> correct decisions in a row, the morning will come and the path to freedom will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime: 15 - 60 minutes</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgot</strong> is a short anomaly hunting horror game. You play as a boy who is imprisoned at home with his grandparents. But is this really your home and are you sure those are your grandparents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to leave, but no exit leads to the outside. The rooms are looping endlessly and time seems to be standing still. It is midnight and &quot;grandmother&quot; won't let you leave before the morning. She keeps feeding you cake and sends you back to your room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes your surroundings change and sometimes they stay the same... Look out for anomalies and make a decision:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are there anomalies at home?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cake is poisoned, do <strong>NOT</strong> eat it and leave immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Does everything look normal?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cake is <strong>safe</strong> and delicious, make sure to eat it on your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only if you make <strong>12</strong> correct decisions in a row, the morning will come and the path to freedom will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime: 15 - 60 minutes</i></p>", "short_description": "You are trapped at home in an endless loop. Remember your surroundings and watch out for anomalies, if you ever want to leave.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/58036b4ec01560ee0622fe7562918d1324db69cf/header.jpg?t=1764953804", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/05690d6a0e1cff83de7b044ddd2b313a84166b85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764953804", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/05690d6a0e1cff83de7b044ddd2b313a84166b85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764953804", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong